sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Ag as EI Graphics agent
    participant Dr as Doctor
    participant In as ADO intake
    participant Sk as Domain skill
    participant Sc as Core scripts
    participant Rn as aveva-rnd

    Dev->>Ag: story link
    Ag->>Dr: check decision cache, run if absent
    alt Doctor blocked
        Dr-->>Ag: BLOCKED
        Ag->>Dev: setup issue, cannot proceed
    else Doctor ready
        Dr-->>Ag: Ready
        Ag->>In: fetch story, images, comments
        In->>Sc: write ado.json
        Ag->>Ag: read ado.json, draft understanding
        Ag->>Sc: log phase: ado-intake
        Ag->>Dev: Checkpoint 1
        Dev-->>Ag: agree on understanding
        Ag->>Sc: write story-understanding.json
        Ag->>Sc: log phase: human-checkpoint
        Ag->>Sc: get domain skill catalog
        Ag->>Sk: match bug pattern, read key files
        Ag->>Sc: log phase: understanding
        Ag->>Dev: Checkpoint 2 when large
        alt Large change
            Dev-->>Ag: approve plan
            Ag->>Sc: write approved-files.json
        else Small bug
            note over Ag: proceed to implementation
        end
        Ag->>Sc: log phase: implementation
        Ag->>Ag: apply surgical fix, run tests
        Ag->>Sc: layer guard and drift check
        Ag->>Sc: log phase: validation
        alt Clear
            Ag->>Rn: review, commit, PR
        else Violation or drift
            Ag->>Dev: report violation and stop
        end
        Ag->>Sc: finalize session and render summary
        Ag->>Sc: log phase: commit
        Ag->>Sc: export session bundle (if path set)
        Ag->>Dev: summary link
    end
